# Security Policy

## Reporting a vulnerability
If you believe you have found a security issue or vulnerability in the Gossip Analytics Unity SDK, please report it to:

privacy@gossipanalytics.com

Please include:
- A clear description of the issue
- Steps to reproduce (if possible)
- Affected versions/commit
- Any relevant logs or screenshots (redact API keys and sensitive data)

Please do not open public GitHub issues for security reports.
